      Workload            Before       After       Change
      Graph500 64C128T    30m 41.8s    15m 14.8s   -50.3%
      Graph500 16C32T     15m 56.7s     9m 43.7s   -39.0%
      Pagerank 32T         1m 58.5s     1m 12.8s   -38.5%
